 "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9742294", "author": {"steamid": "76561197973769111", "personaname": "Putraman", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Putraman/", "num_games_owned": 647, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 287, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 287, "last_played": 1396541268, "avatar": "be458d103d784091f3d1e6eb6933eb6986a6af80"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great option for 3–4 players. For a top-down shooter it's full of challenge so teamwork and communication is vital; if you don't use third-party VoIP then [i]Alien Swarm[/i] sports a range of tools (voice comms, voice messages, map tool) to facilitiate some form of control.\n\nIt may only be nine missions but with limited ammo, friendly-fire and no player respawns, expect to get familiar with the failure screen. Best part of it all is that, for some inexplicable reason, [i]Alien Swarm[/] is free!", "timestamp_created": 1396775460, "timestamp_updated": 1396775460, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "9742024", "author": {"steamid": "76561198078065047", "personaname": "BearpunchGunsmoke", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/bearpunchgsmoke/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 271, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 271, "last_played": 1397008051, "avatar": "e35b436b2ad9ddf56deff6c7235bccc74ce96b6c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Pretty good, but it didn't have garfield.  2/10", "timestamp_created": 1396773204, "timestamp_updated": 1396773204, "voted_up